note spec/omegese-om2.md section 2 lines 53-58 (#745): signed minima are written in decimal (no - before hex); hex
note operands compare and add with them under the decimal range rule. Exit 0.
om2
fn main to int
x = byte -128
y = long -9223372036854775808
if ge int x 0x0
ret 1
end
if ge y 0x0
ret 2
end
ret int add int x 0x80
end
